  "h1En": "Global storefront & publisher top 10",
  "h1Zh": "全球游戏平台前十（营收 / 装机口径）",
  "updated": "2026-06-22",
  "editorialHtmlEn": "<p>Steam and the three console families lead PC / living-room spend; Tencent-level mobile giants sit in “more” because their web hubs differ.</p><p>Last reviewed: <strong>2026-06-22</strong>. Piracy indexes, keygens, and unofficial ROM hosts are never listed.</p><p><strong>Who this page is for:</strong> readers who already follow a few storefront blogs but want a ranked top-10 plus three official links per vendor — not a discovery feed for unknown APK sites. Major client updates still show up in the per-row news slots when you run <code>npm run fetch-hub-news</code>; mobile-only MMO portals stay in “more” so the top ten stays comparable to Western revenue tables.</p><p><strong>Editorial cross-link:</strong> first game-original on this hub: <a href=\"/articles/steam-charts-bestsellers-most-played.html\">Reading Steam Charts</a>; character look-dev in <a href=\"/articles/game-girl-elena-sea-wind-reference.html\">Elena · Sea-Wind</a>, <a href=\"/articles/game-girl-elena-palette-ritual-notes.html\">palette & ritual UI</a>, and <a href=\"/articles/games-hub-generative-art-workflow.html\">Games hub × generative art workflow</a>.</p>",
  "editorialHtmlZh": "<p>PC 与客厅支出仍是 Steam 加御三家打头；腾讯系手游体量也很大，但主站形态不同，放在「更多」里。</p><p>最近核对：<strong>2026-06-22</strong>。盗版索引、破解与非官方 ROM 站点一律不收录。</p><p><strong>适合谁看：</strong>已经会逛几家商店官网，但需要对照营收梯队、并点到各厂三条官方链接的人；不把它当成 APK 发现站。大版本更新仍会出现在每行「最新动态」里；纯手游 MMO 门户放在「更多」，好让前十行仍能和常见欧美营收表对照。</p><p><strong>原创交叉链：</strong>游戏 Hub 原创轮播首篇 <a href=\"/articles/steam-charts-bestsellers-most-played.html\">Steam Charts 怎么读</a>；角色设定见 <a href=\"/articles/game-girl-elena-sea-wind-reference.html\">艾琳娜 · 海风之诗</a>、<a href=\"/articles/game-girl-elena-palette-ritual-notes.html\">配色与仪式 UI</a>，工作流 <a href=\"/articles/games-hub-generative-art-workflow.html\">游戏 Hub × 生成式角色美术</a>。</p>",
  "rankTitleEn": "Global top 10 (platforms)",
